    engine3d_ext_impl_blocks_never_imported_2026-07-02, 1, "Root cause: required RenderBackend3D methods lived in plain impl blocks of *_ext.spl siblings, invisible to TraitImpl.validate_methods. dcc7d3b052a and siblings moved them into the primary trait impls for 11 backends; vulkan_ext.spl still re-declared 26 required methods inherently (duplicate of the trait impl, rejected by HIR). Fix: delete that duplicate inherent block, keep tessellation/geometry/multi-draw + Engine3DExtended, import Engine3DExtended. Spec test/01_unit/lib/gpu/engine3d/backend_trait_impl_completeness_hir_spec.spl (25 examples): earlier run red 13/25; on this loaded Windows host it hits the 900s child timeout, so verified by an equivalent static awk check: all 12 backends missing=0, ext overlap=0 (vulkan overlap 26 -> 0). gc_sync_mut ext files are 3-line re-exports."

